OpenPocketCine 0.1.5: clearer joystick and gimbal controls; experimental Multiview for up to four cameras; LEVEL and Double-tap Level; Osmo Action 6 support (not yet checked on a real Action 6). Fixes Live View crashes (including some MediaTek phones), shorter freezes after dropped video packets, Nano zoom and clip deletion, plus about 65% less Live View CPU use. Share Diagnostics has more stall detail. Full notes: https://openpocketcine.app/docs/releases/0-1-5/
